<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - AFLAC Inc raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - AFLAC Inc raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it upgraded AFLAC Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 7/8 to 40-1/2.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
